  "limitations": [
    "CPU/mock training and serving fixtures validate real operator ownership and exporter behavior, not GPU execution, utilization, sharing or application idleness.",
    "Workloads ran sequentially in memory-conscious operator batches, not concurrently at production scale.",
    "Owned and mapped Pod totals sum observations for fixture roots across separate cases; independent dependency roots are checked separately and excluded from those totals; they are not peak cardinality.",
    "Collector forwarding is an OTLP bridge; the exporter itself exposes Prometheus and does not send native OTLP.",
    "OTLP deletion uses a 10-second source-timestamp freshness guard; it does not assert identical backend retention semantics.",
    "Transport evidence records explicit Prometheus and Collector version tags; it does not record their immutable runtime digests.",
    "Raw local evidence includes superseded images and failed warmups; only the explicitly listed final results are claimed as passing.",
    "The immutable build source manifest predates documented test-fixture corrections; production source hashes were rechecked unchanged before each batch."
  ]
